; GRIFO in-game UI tiles (ui-designer). BG/window tiles, black on white.
; Resident in VRAM during PLAY / PAUSE / CONTINUAR. Load at BG tile 0 (BLANK = tile 0).
; VRAM order in game: ui (0-23), font (24-64), bg (65-). Title/clear/gameover art lives in
; uiscreens.tiles (loaded only with the LCD off, over the bg slots).
; Consecutive runs (code relies on them, append only): BAR_0..BAR_8, FRAME_TL..FRAME_BR.

; ---------------- HUD icons and boss bar
; white (space). In game it can alias the bg BLANK tile
@ BLANK
